     1,
     "Hello everyone, <div><br></div><div>I have a rather specific question. I have an old dartseq file that I would like to use for an analysis but the data I have is in double row format and I need it in single row to run a particular bit of code. For some reason DArT didn&#39;t supply a single row sheet back then. </div><div>I could try ask them for it but I was wondering if there might be an easy way to use dartR to read in a double row as per usual and do a double2singlerow or something to retain all the loci metadata? </div><div><br></div><div>Thanks, </div><div>Katrin</div><div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
