     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Katrin,</div><div><br></div><div>You could try</div><div><br></div><div>gl.write.csv(<a href=\"http://testset.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458864588000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0NiQE2TfJrun8vGxBh3-yx\">testset.gl</a>, outfile=&quot;SNP_1row.csv&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>But caution with the coding. I think this will have 0 homozygous ref, 1 heterozygous, 2 homozygous alternate, which is different coding from that in a DArT one-row file.</div><div><br></div><div>A</div><br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
