     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">Hi Olly, <div>I would like to run code (non-dartR) on the raw single row data sheet. yes, dartR can import either and can create a genlight from either. </div><div>I just need to get the raw data (not genlight) in a csv as a single row. </div><div><br></div><div>Cheers, </div><div>Katrin<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thursday, 15 July 2021 at 12:42:22 pm UTC+10 <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">oliver...@csiro.au</a> wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Hi Katrin,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Do you mean you want to run code on the 2 row format or on a genlight created from 2 row format?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\">I’m pretty sure dartR can import the 2 row format.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Cheers,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Olly<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:rgb(0,169,206)\">-----<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:rgb(0,169,206)\">Oliver Berry</span></b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:black\">Leader, Environomics Future Science Platform\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:black\">National Collections and Marine Infrastructure  </span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:rgb(0,169,206)\">|</span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:black\">  CSIRO </span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:black\"><a rel=\"nofollow\">oliver...@csiro.au</a></span></u><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:black\">  </span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:rgb(0,169,206)\">|</span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:black\"> \r\n 08 9333 6584  </span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:rgb(0,169,206)\">|</span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:black\">  0400 747 197<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:black\">Indian Ocean Marine Research Centre, The University of Western Australia, Crawley, WA, 6009, Australia</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:rgb(118,113,113)\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:rgb(118,113,113)\"><a href=\"https://ecos.csiro.au/edna-barcode-library/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ecos.csiro.au/edna-barcode-library/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458864588000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GYMPSPbAigjhpg80365rT\">Read about our plan to create a DNA barcode library for all Australian species!</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:rgb(118,113,113)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:rgb(118,113,113)\"><a href=\"http://www.csiro.au/environomics\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.csiro.au/environomics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458864588000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ATrqBmLyywoHsaELbFlP6\">http://www.csiro.au/environomics</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:rgb(117,117,121)\"> <b>CSIRO </b>Australia’s National Science Agency  |  csiro.au</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div><div lang=\"EN-AU\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"border-color:rgb(225,225,225) currentcolor currentcolor;border-style:solid none none;border-width:1pt medium medium;padding:3pt 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> <a rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Katrin Hohwieler<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, 15 July 2021 10:24 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> dartR &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [dartR] transforming double row to single row<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello everyone, <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I have a rather specific question. I have an old dartseq file that I would like to use for an analysis but the data I have is in double row format and I need it in single row to run a particular bit of code. For some reason DArT didn&#39;t\r\n supply a single row sheet back then. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I could try ask them for it but I was wondering if there might be an easy way to use dartR to read in a double row as per usual and do a double2singlerow or something to retain all the loci metadata? <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks, <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Katrin<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div><div lang=\"EN-AU\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/8a1001fa-470b-4fb0-9ece-57c89a867b92n%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/8a1001fa-470b-4fb0-9ece-57c89a867b92n%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458864588000&amp;usg=AOvVaw225ImKRZuSk26GNHZPce-p\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/8a1001fa-470b-4fb0-9ece-57c89a867b92n%40googlegroups.com</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br></blockquote></div>"
