     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Hi Katrin,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>I think Arthurs suggestion gl.write.csv<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>And then you could use excel to swap the coding (from 0/1/2 from genlight (1=heterozygote) to 2=heterozygote in the dart coding scheme.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Easiest is to replace all 1’s to say ‘H’ and then all 2 to ones and back all Hs to twos.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>That should do the recoding if I am not mistaken.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Cheers, Bernd <u></u>\r\n<u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">==============================================================================<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Dr Bernd Gruber\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                                            )/_         \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                                                         _.